                : "A long press of the wall switch while the light is off: on (the default), the light comes on at its minimum, waits there 0.7 s and rises while the switch is held, so it can be let go at any level from the lowest; off, it comes on at its level as for a short press and the hold dims from there (Open Dimmer firmware)")
            .withCategory("config");
