    // Following another channel's wall switch (dimmer-only builds, any MCU: the module does it;
    // genOnOffSwitchCfg 0xff17..0xff19, kept by the module): which channel (0 none, its index
    // + 1, as dimmerNames), the level at its on and at its off (0: off).
    // always: shown with any MCU (the ZH-Z06's virtual MCU); else as the Open Dimmer settings
    // (a ZDMS16-2 with its factory MCU keeps the entities it had; the module still follows).
    dimmerFollow: (endpointName, dimmerNames, always = false) => {
