    // Lamp compensation (Open Dimmer 2.2.8, DP 172 / 173, lightingBallastCfg 0xff11): levels
    // of output taken off after the light came down, for lamps that are brighter then; 255 from
    // the module: the MCU does not have it.
    // always: the ZH-Z06's virtual MCU (any version; its dimming MCU is taken as linear, which has
